# ============================================================
# A-Share Antifragile Trading Loop
#
# Stack:
# - Python 3.10+ scripts and unittest tests
# - pandas core; yfinance/matplotlib/akshare optional
# - JSON/YAML/Markdown configuration and documentation
# - OpenClaw skill metadata (package.json; no Node runtime required)
#
# Policy: commit source, tests, public docs, examples, and README assets.
# Ignore secrets, personal portfolio data, caches, logs, generated reports,
# charts, exports, local automation state, and build artifacts.
# ============================================================

